9
00:00:18,785 --> 00:00:20,855
(Penny:)Well, I'm gonna stay positive.
I mean, we talked.

10
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:23,324
(Penny:)I told him what women like,
and after he stopped giggling,

11
00:00:23,323 --> 00:00:25,723
